The '''Magma Slug''' is an {{Uncommon}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up from {{Item|Lava}} in the {{Zone|Crimson Isle}}.

== Spawning ==
The '''Magma Slug''' can be fished up from any body of Lava in the [[Crimson Isle]] with a Lava [[Fishing Rods|Fishing Rod]]. It requires {{Skill|Fishing|27}} to be fished up.

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for the '''Magma Slug''' is {{Green|1,600}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|34.42%|1|2.91|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Currently there are no modifiers that can be used to increase it.

